Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: AnonVoid Team <support@anonvoid.local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt6, tor, dnscrypt-proxy, nftables, util-linux
Recommends: fstrim
Suggests: nuitka
Provides: fp-cleaner
Replaces: fp-cleaner
Installed-Size: 1024
Homepage: https://github.com/ali0zdas/anonvoid
Description: AnonVoid - Linux Digital Footprint & Anti-Forensics Cleaner
 AnonVoid, Linux isletim sistemlerinde arkada sifir adli iz (zero self-footprint)
 birakarak sistem gunluklerini, kabuk gecmislerini, tarayici onbelleklerini, RAM ve swap
 alanlarini temizleyen ve tum ag trafigini Tor & DNSCrypt uzerinden nftables ile yonlendiren
 guvenlik ve gizlilik merkezidir.
